  "programme": "A Little League-sized ball diamond: 60 ft bases, a 46 ft pitching distance and a 200 ft outfield fence with a yellow cap and foul poles; a grass infield inside a dirt arc, a raised mound, a warning track and chalked lines; a 6 m chain-link backstop with a hood, side fences and two block dugouts; aluminium bleachers and benches on a concrete apron; four field lights and a blank scoreboard; a path loop round the outfield with benches, through lawn, prairie beds, flowering cherries and groves of aspen, green ash, bur oak and white spruce.",
